Wait — "已分配" should probably be the existing allocation before this request. allocated - proposedForP = effective allocation excluding this request's proposed amounts = stored allocations of children not in request. Note: if a child in request is a revision, its stored value is excluded from "already". That's a reasonable definition: 已分配 = 除本请求外已落定分配. Good.

Note out==null case: message should also mention parent. Fine.

Edge: parent P not registered and no children allocations and P is an item being registered itself → allocated=0, no error. Good.

Edge: child item where parent has yield → check sum. Good.

