private YieldRecordResponse toYieldResponse(YieldRow row) {
    return new YieldRecordResponse(row.batchKey(), row.inputQty().toPlainString(), row.outputQty().toPlainString(), yieldRate(row), row.version(), row.operator(), Instant.parse(row.createdAt()), Instant.parse(row.updatedAt()));
}
private String yieldRate(YieldRow row) {
    return row.outputQty().divide(row.inputQty(), 4, RoundingMode.HALF_UP).toPlainString();
}
```
divide with scale 4 → "0.6667" exactly 4 decimals. Good.

validateQty:
```java
private void validateQty(BigDecimal qty, String field) {
    if (qty.signum() <= 0) throw badRequest(field + " 必须大于零");
    if (qty.stripTrailingZeros().scale() > 3) throw badRequest(field + " 最多三位小数");
    if (qty.precision() - qty.scale() > 16) throw badRequest(field + " 超出数值范围");
}
```
Careful: scale of e.g. 100 → scale 0; 0.1000 → stripTrailingZeros → 0.1 scale 1. Good. Negative scale (1E+3 → scale -3) fine. precision check: DECIMAL(19,3) → integer digits ≤ 16. qty.precision()-qty.scale(): for 123.45, precision 5, scale 2 → 3. For 1E+17 → precision 1, scale -17 → 18 > 16 → reject. OK.

normQty: stripTrailingZeros().toPlainString().

